<urn:atm:triage:finding/RSH-T7-003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RSH-T7-003" ;
  triage:title "tracing::warn! in overflow path missing dropped_count and session_id fields" ;
  triage:description "QA finding claimed the tracing::warn! at graft_runtime.rs:198 was missing dropped_count and session_id structured fields. Sweep of T.7 and T.8 shows both fields ARE present in the warn! call at lines 199-203: session_id = %session_id and dropped_count = session.dropped_count. This finding is a false positive. The overflow warn! is correctly structured. No fix required." ;
